* '''Fort de Sant Cristòfor''' — the original sixteenth-century Volisanian fort, now a national museum
* '''Catedral de Sant Cristòfor''' — colonial-era cathedral in the historic centre
* [[National Assembly of Balboa|National Assembly building]] — seat of the national legislature
* [[Borsa de Sant Cristòfor]] — the largest stock exchange in the isthmus region
* [[Sant Cristòfor Free Trade Zone]] — the largest free trade zone in Lurandia
* '''Museu de les Illes''' — museum of island history on Illa Daurada
* [[Illa del Portal]] — nature reserve and former quarantine station
